  "caveats": [
    "The support SIZE is not an invariant — it moves with q. Only the FACT of separation and the letters used are stable. Quoting '|support| = 6 for T, 9 for He3' as a structural result would be quoting a vertex count.",
    "OWNER RULING (2026-08-31): x_free's 108 negative coordinates at A=3 are not a defect. x_free is the tensor product of the individual nucleon NFs with no inter-nucleon crossings — the FREE constituents of the atom — and the constituents are not asked to be in a stable configuration. Positivity is imposed on the solution only. The previous probe's flagged tension is resolved in favour of the construction as it stands.",
    "Everything is rebuilt per q so nothing is carried over from q_0, but the LP itself runs at f64 after an mpmath (30-40 dps) algebra stage. Support membership is thresholded at x_i > 1e-9; near a vertex flip that threshold is the deciding quantity, which is part of why the size is not treated as an invariant."
